    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Dead Town</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a junkyard in a town frozen in time. The only survivors are people with mechanical parts, each trying to stay alive. As you explore the destroyed buildings - school, hospital, church - you slowly uncover what happened to this place, and discover who you really are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices shape what happens next. Face your past.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Retro Horror</strong>: Experience a psychological horror adventure with haunting visuals and a compelling narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful Choices</strong>: Your actions and decisions shape the story, leading to multiple endings that reflect your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling</strong>: Piece together the town's dark history through notes, photographs, and scattered memories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complex Puzzles</strong>: Challenge yourself with puzzles that blend seamlessly with the narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Character Development</strong>: Interact with survivors in a dead town, each carrying their own secrets and mechanical modifications</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Dead Town</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a junkyard in a town frozen in time. The only survivors are people with mechanical parts, each trying to stay alive. As you explore the destroyed buildings - school, hospital, church - you slowly uncover what happened to this place, and discover who you really are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices shape what happens next. Face your past.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Retro Horror</strong>: Experience a psychological horror adventure with haunting visuals and a compelling narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful Choices</strong>: Your actions and decisions shape the story, leading to multiple endings that reflect your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling</strong>: Piece together the town's dark history through notes, photographs, and scattered memories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complex Puzzles</strong>: Challenge yourself with puzzles that blend seamlessly with the narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Character Development</strong>: Interact with survivors in a dead town, each carrying their own secrets and mechanical modifications</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
